{"speciesId":23,"names":{"fr":"Abo","es":"Ekans","en":"Ekans","ja":"アーボ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Moves silently and stealthily. Eats the eggs of birds, such as PIDGEY and SPEAROW, whole."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Moves silently and stealthily. Eats the eggs of birds, such as PIDGEY and SPEAROW, whole."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"The older it gets, the longer it grows. At night, it wraps its long body around tree branches to rest."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It can freely de­ tach its jaw to swallow large prey whole. It can be­ come too heavy to move, however."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It always hides in grass. When first born, it has no poison, so its bite is painful, but harmless."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It flutters the tip of its tongue to seek out the scent of prey, then swallows the prey whole."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"EKANS curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare from its upraised head."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"EKANS curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare from its upraised head."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"An EKANS curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. This position allows it to quickly respond to an enemy from any direction with a threat from its upraised head."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A very common sight in grassland, etc. It flicks its tongue in and out to sense danger in its surroundings."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Moving silently and stealthily, it eats the eggs of birds, such as PIDGEY and SPEAROW, whole."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It can freely detach its jaw to swallow large prey whole. It can become too heavy to move, however."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It always hides in grass. When first born, it has no poison, so its bite is painful, but harmless."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il se faufile dans l’herbe sans un bruit et frappe dans le dos quand sa proie s’y attend le moins."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se faufile dans l’herbe sans un bruit et frappe dans le dos quand sa proie s’y attend le moins."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Plus il est âgé, plus son corps est long. Il se love autour des arbres pour se reposer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuanto más viejo, más crece este Pokémon. Por la noche, descansa en las ramas de los árboles."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The older it gets, the longer it grows. At night, it wraps its long body around tree branches to rest."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"育つほどに どんどん 長くなる。 そして 夜中は 木の枝に グルグルと 絡まって 休む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se déplace en silence pour dévorer des œufs de Roucool ou de Piafabec."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es muy silencioso y cauteloso. Come huevos de pájaros como los de Pidgey y Spearow."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Moving silently and stealthily, it eats the eggs of birds, such as Pidgey and Spearow, whole."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"まったく 気配を 感じさせずに 移動する。ポッポや オニスズメの タマゴを まるのみ してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Abo s’enroule en spirale pour dormir. Sa tête reste relevée de telle sorte que cette position lui permette de réagir rapidement si une menace survenait."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ekans se enrosca para descansar. Adoptando esta posición puede responder rápidamente a cualquier amenaza que le aceche desde cualquier lugar, levantando la cabeza con una feroz mirada."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ekans curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare from its upraised head."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"ぐるぐる 体を 巻いて 休んでいるのは どの 方向から 敵が 襲ってきても とっさに 頭を 向けて 威嚇できるからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Abo s’enroule en spirale pour dormir. Sa tête reste relevée de telle sorte que cette position lui permette de réagir rapidement si une menace survenait."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ekans se enrosca para descansar. Adoptando esta posición puede responder rápidamente a cualquier amenaza que le aceche desde cualquier lugar, levantando la cabeza con una feroz mirada."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ekans curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare from its upraised head."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ぐるぐる 体を 巻いて 休んでいるのは どの 方向から 敵が 襲ってきても とっさに 頭を 向けて 威嚇できるからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il peut se déboîter la mâchoire pour avaler tout rond des proies plus grosses que lui. Il se replie ensuite sur lui-même pour digérer."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es capaz de desencajar la mandíbula para engullir presas enteras mayores que él mismo, tras lo cual se enrosca para descansar."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"By dislocating its jaw, it can swallow prey larger than itself. After a meal, it curls up and rests."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"顎を 外すことで 自分より 大きな 獲物も 丸呑みに する。 食後は 身体を 丸め 休む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il aime tout particulièrement les œufs des Pokémon oiseaux. Comme il les avale d’un coup, il lui arrive de s’étouffer et de s’évanouir."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Los huevos de Pokémon pájaro son su manjar predilecto. Como se los traga enteros, en ocasiones se atraganta y pierde el conocimiento."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The eggs of bird Pokémon are its favorite food. It swallows eggs whole, so sometimes an egg gets stuck, and Ekans faints."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"とりポケモンの タマゴが 好物。 噛まずに 丸呑みするので 喉が 詰まって 気を 失うことも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Plus il est âgé, plus son corps est long. La nuit, il s’enroule autour de branches d’arbres pour se reposer."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"La longitud de este Pokémon aumenta con el tiempo. Por la noche, se enrosca en las ramas de los árboles para descansar."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"The older it gets, the longer it grows. At night, it wraps its long body around tree branches to rest."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"育つほどに どんどん 長くなる。 そして 夜中は 木の枝に グルグルと からまって 休む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Plus il est âgé, plus son corps est long. La nuit, il s’enroule autour de branches d’arbres pour se reposer."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"La longitud de este Pokémon aumenta con el tiempo. Por la noche, se enrosca en las ramas de los árboles para descansar."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"The older it gets, the longer it grows. At night, it wraps its long body around tree branches to rest."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"育つほどに どんどん 長くなる。 そして 夜中は 木の枝に グルグルと からまって 休む。"}],"varieties":[{"id":23,"moves":[{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[3,"egg",0],[4,"egg",0],[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[19,"level-up",28],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"poison-sting","learns":[[1,"level-up",10],[2,"level-up",10],[3,"level-up",9],[4,"level-up",9],[5,"level-up",8],[6,"level-up",8],[7,"level-up",8],[8,"level-up",4],[9,"level-up",4],[10,"level-up",4],[11,"level-up",4],[12,"level-up",8],[13,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4],[